[TEST] Please provide the findings from the non-contrast CT head and CT cervical spine — specifically reporting presence/absence and characteristics of:  
- Intracranial hemorrhage (epidural, subdural, subarachnoid, intraparenchymal);  
- Cerebral contusions or edema;  
- Midline shift (in mm);  
- Skull or facial bone fractures;  
- Cervical spine fractures or ligamentous injury.

