[TEST] Please provide results for the following initial trauma laboratory studies:  
- Hemoglobin and hematocrit;  
- Platelet count;  
- INR and PT;  
- aPTT;  
- Blood alcohol concentration (BAC);  
- Urine toxicology screen (including opioids, benzodiazepines, cocaine, amphetamines, THC).

